Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久很久以前 在一个遥远的银河系…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.89,0:00:36.66,Title,0,0,0,0,,《星球大战：原力觉醒》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.68,0:00:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克·天行者不见踪影
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.49,0:00:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他消失期间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,由帝国残余势力组成的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶的第一秩序已然崛起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在除掉最后一个绝地武士
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.42,0:00:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者之前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一秩序绝不卸甲休兵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.84,0:00:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在共和国的鼎力支持下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.59,0:00:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱娅·奥加纳将军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,领导着一个勇敢的抵抗组织
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.05,0:00:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不顾一切地想要找到哥哥卢克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,从而在他的帮助下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.28,0:00:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,恢复银河系的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.89,0:01:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,和平与公正
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.91,0:01:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱娅已派出最英勇的飞行员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.46,0:01:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,前往贾库星球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.34,0:01:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,执行秘密任务
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.93,0:01:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,该星球的一位老盟友发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,揭示卢克行踪的线索…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.57,0:44:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又犯了一个错误 索洛 你就是想赖账
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.05,0:45:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,两次
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.97,0:45:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也无处可躲
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.37,0:45:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜查这艘运输舰
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.44,0:58:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现抵抗者
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.98,0:58:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要找的机器人也在这
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.41,0:58:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知第一秩序 我找到机器人了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.79,0:02:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个东西会让一切步入正轨的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will begin to make things right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.98,0:03:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已游历各处 阅尽沧桑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've traveled too far and seen too much{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以致忽略了弥漫在银河系中的绝望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to ignore the despair in the galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.92,0:03:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有了绝地武士 原力绝无平衡的可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the Jedi, there can be no balance in the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是因为你 如今我们才拥有了一个机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, because of you, now we have a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将军已经追查此事许久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The General's been after this for a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the General?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我来说她可是皇室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me, she is royalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.77,0:03:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她当然是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she certainly is that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.61,0:03:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.42,0:03:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得藏起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.90,0:03:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.03,0:04:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快来 BB-8 动作快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, BB-8, hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.59,0:04:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}炸掉那架X翼战机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blast that X-Wing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.83,0:04:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那 在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there! Over there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.99,0:04:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后方有敌人来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone is coming behind us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿着 它在你这里比在我这里更安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它在你这里比在我这里更安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's safer with you than it is with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.56,0:05:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赶快离开这里 越远越好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get as far away from here as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.85,0:05:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 听明白了吗 - 我不知道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you hear me? - I don't know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.69,0:05:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会回来找你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come back for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.73,0:05:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都会安然无恙的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.16,0:06:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续前进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.63,0:06:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}守在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.59,0:06:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瞧瞧你变得多老了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look how old you've become.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.07,0:07:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你经历了比变老糟糕得多的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something far worse has happened to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你明白我为何而来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I've come for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你从何而来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where you come from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.27,0:07:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你称呼自己为凯洛·伦之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you called yourself Kylo Ren.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经找到了天行者所在位置的地图 我们都心知肚明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The map to Skywalker. We know you found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.25,0:07:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在你要将这份地图上交给第一秩序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're going to give it to the First Order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.92,0:07:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一秩序是从黑暗面崛起的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The First Order rose from the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.88,0:07:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.84,0:07:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会让你见识一下黑暗面的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你不可否认的事实是 那是你的家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you cannot deny the truth that is your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.62,0:07:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说的太对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.85,0:08:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 谁先开始讲话呢 你 还是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who talks first? You talk first? I talk first?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.06,0:08:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老家伙把地图交给你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man gave it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听懂你讲话真是太困难了 因为你整张脸都…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just very hard to understand you with all the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.77,0:08:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 给我搜 - 仪器…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Search him. - …apparatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.44,0:08:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么也没有 长官 - 把他带到船上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing, sir. - Put him on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.45,0:08:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长官 村民如何处置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, the villagers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.54,0:08:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全部灭口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.25,0:08:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听我命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.80,0:08:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.18,0:08:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里什么也没有 清除这架战机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing here. Go ahead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.58,0:09:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行了 我自己走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.65,0:10:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}FN-2187{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}FN-2187.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.87,0:10:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上交你的爆能枪以供检查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Submit your blaster for inspection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.99,0:10:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁准许你摘掉头盔的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who gave you permission to remove that helmet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.49,0:10:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我的错 队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马上去我的部门报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Report to my division at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天你带过来的值…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you brought me today is worth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}四分之一份口粮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}one quarter portion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.21,0:15:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太感谢啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.84,0:15:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那只是一个蒂多 想把你拆成零件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just Teedo. Wants you for parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对任何人都没有丝毫的尊重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has no respect for anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的天线折弯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your antenna's bent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.56,0:15:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你来自哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.62,0:15:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能讲的 这是机密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not suppose to tell, it's classified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.02,0:15:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 机密 真的假的 - 真的呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Classified, really? - Yup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.69,0:15:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来自的地方也是个巨大的秘密呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too. Big secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.35,0:16:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尼伊马贸易哨站在那个方向 离开尔文山脉远一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Niima Outpost is that way. Stay off Kelvin Ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.57,0:16:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}千万别靠近北部下沉区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep away from the Sinking Fields in the north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.51,0:16:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则你会淹没在沙子里的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll drown in the sand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.62,0:16:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是太善良啦 我想跟你一起走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so very kind. I would like to come with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.08,0:16:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别跟着我 镇子在那个方向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't follow me. Town is that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.71,0:16:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我可以跟你待在一起吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Then, can I stay with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.39,0:16:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.07,0:16:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人家好害怕的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.56,0:16:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明早你就出发离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the morning, you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再次谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.99,0:16:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.83,0:16:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们把抵抗组织最厉害的飞行员抓到船上了 我竟毫不知情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea we had the best pilot in the Resistance on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.34,0:17:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}躺得还舒服吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comfortable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不太舒服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.39,0:17:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很是佩服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm impressed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.18,0:17:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}目前还没人能撬开你的嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one has been able to get out of you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.60,0:17:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}获取地图的下落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you did with the map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.09,0:17:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可得重新考虑下你的审问技巧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to rethink your technique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.91,0:17:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地图在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.37,0:17:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抵抗组织不会屈服于{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Resistance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.79,0:17:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的淫威之下的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will not be intimidated by you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.97,0:17:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where… is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.73,0:17:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地图藏在一个BB元件机器人里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in a droid. A BB unit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.57,0:18:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 如果这个机器人在贾库 我们很快就会找到它的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, if it's on Jakku, we'll soon have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.34,0:18:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那这件事就交给你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave that to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.74,0:18:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要放弃希望 不管你等的机密人物是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give up hope. He still might show up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.70,0:18:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还是可能会出现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever it is you're waiting for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}机密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Classified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.08,0:18:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我十分了解等待的滋味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all about waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.93,0:18:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.84,0:18:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总有一天会回来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be back. One day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.53,0:18:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这五件价值…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These five pieces are worth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.13,0:18:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.89,0:18:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}二分之一份口粮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}one half portion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.69,0:18:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上周每一件还值二分之一口粮的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last week they were a half portion each.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.52,0:18:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个机器人呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the droid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.02,0:18:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}机器人怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.19,0:18:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要买下他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pay for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}60份口粮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixty portions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.90,0:19:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.55,0:19:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个机器人不卖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The droid's not for sale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.92,0:19:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.10,0:19:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟着这个女孩 给我抓到那个机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow the girl and get that droid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伦想见一下犯人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ren wants the prisoner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.16,0:19:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边转弯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.37,0:19:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好好听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen carefully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.44,0:19:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你完全按照我说的做 我可以帮你离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do exactly as I say, I can get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.86,0:19:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说啥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.13,0:19:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是一项援救行动 我是来帮你逃出去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a rescue. I'm helping you escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会驾驶钛战机吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you fly a TIE fighter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.74,0:19:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是抵抗组织的一员吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're with the Resistance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.09,0:19:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么 不是 我只是来帮你逃出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No, no, no. I'm breaking you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.31,0:19:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你会驾驶钛战机吗 - 没有什么飞行器是我驾驶不了的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you fly a TIE fighter? - I can fly anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.85,0:19:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么 为什么帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why are you helping me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.81,0:19:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为这才是应该做的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's the right thing to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你需要一位飞行员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need a pilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.78,0:20:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的确需要一位飞行员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a pilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.88,0:20:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就要逃出去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.13,0:20:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.16,0:20:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 保持冷静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Stay calm. Stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.84,0:20:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我挺冷静的 - 我是在跟自己说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am calm. - I'm talking to myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.80,0:20:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.33,0:20:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以了 这边走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, go. This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.30,0:20:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直都想着能驾驶一下钛战机呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always wanted to fly one of these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.71,0:20:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你会射击吗 - 我会用爆能枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you shoot? - Blasters, I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.81,0:20:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 原理是一样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, same principle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.05,0:20:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}使用左侧开关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use the toggle on the left…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.14,0:20:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}切换导弹 加农炮和麦加脉冲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to switch between missiles, cannons and mag pulse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.93,0:20:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}右边的准星用来瞄准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use the sight on the right to aim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.77,0:20:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 扳柄用来开火 - 这也太复杂了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Triggers to fire. - This is very complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.15,0:20:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能解决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can fix this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.57,0:20:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二停机场有一架战机未经许可起飞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have an unsanctioned departure from bay two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通知赫克斯将军 并阻止那艘战机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alert General Hux. And stop that fighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.60,0:21:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}炸掉指挥室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fourteen failed. Eighteen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.77,0:21:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}搞定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这家伙速度真快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing really moves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 我们要是想跑远点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta take out as many of these cannons as we can…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.24,0:21:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就得尽可能地炸掉这些加农炮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we're not gonna get very far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.37,0:21:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 好的 - 我会驾驶到适当位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - I'm gonna get us in position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.20,0:21:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保持警惕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay sharp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.08,0:21:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前方 前方 看到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up ahead! Up ahead! You see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.83,0:21:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我驾驶到正中央了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got us dead center.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.87,0:21:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这一发畅通无阻 - 明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a clean shot. - Okay, got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.76,0:21:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 太棒了 - 真厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah! - Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.67,0:21:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.43,0:21:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 看到有多准了吗 - 看到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you see that? - I saw it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.73,0:22:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 你叫什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.78,0:22:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}FN-2187{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}FN-2187.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.27,0:22:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}F… 什么来着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}F… What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.56,0:22:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是他们给我的唯一名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only name they ever gave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.52,0:22:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会用这个来称呼你 FN 是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I ain't using it. F-N, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.56,0:22:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芬恩 我打算叫你芬恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn. I'm gonna call you Finn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.72,0:22:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以吗 芬恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all right? Finn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.36,0:22:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 芬恩 我喜欢这个名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Finn, I like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.37,0:22:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我太喜欢啦 - 我是波 波·达默龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I like that. - I'm Poe. Poe Dameron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 很高兴认识你 波 - 我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good to meet you, Poe. - Good to meet you too, Finn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.87,0:22:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长官 那两个家伙把我们的涡轮激光炮炸毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, they've taken out our turbolasers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.25,0:22:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}使用腹侧炮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use the ventral cannons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 长官 正在激活腹侧炮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. Bringing them online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.80,0:22:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫克斯将军 是那个抵抗组织的飞行员吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Hux, is it the Resistance pilot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.59,0:22:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 而帮他逃出去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and he had help…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.09,0:22:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我们自己人中的一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from one of our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.26,0:22:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正在检查登记信息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're checking the registers now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.60,0:22:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以识别出该冲锋兵的身份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to identify which stormtrooper it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.60,0:22:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是来自村庄那个 FN-2187{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one from the village. FN-2187.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.60,0:22:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长官 腹侧炮准备完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, ventral cannons hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.44,0:22:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.32,0:23:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朝着你过来的是什么 在我右边 你的左边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One's coming toward you! My right. Your left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.32,0:23:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 看到了吗 - 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you see it? - Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.42,0:23:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.33,0:23:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干得漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice shot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.17,0:23:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们这是往哪里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.38,0:23:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得返回贾库{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going back to Jakku. That's where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.63,0:23:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不不不 我们不能回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We can't go back to Jakku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.45,0:23:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得赶紧逃出这个星系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get out of this system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.69,0:23:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须抢在第一秩序之前找到我的机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get my droid before the First Order does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.81,0:23:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么 机器人 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What, a droid? - That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.14,0:23:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}BB元件机器人 橙白相间 独一无二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a BB unit, orange and white. One of a kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.38,0:23:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我才不在乎他是什么颜色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what color he is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.56,0:23:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有任何机器人能有这么重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No droid can be that important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.83,0:23:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个机器人举足轻重 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is, pal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.60,0:23:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要离第一秩序远一点 越远越好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get as far away from the First Order as we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.77,0:23:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回到贾库 必死无疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go back to Jakku, we die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.08,0:23:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个机器人携带着一个能指引我们找到卢克·天行者的地图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That droid has a map that leads straight to Luke Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.94,0:23:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在逗我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you gotta be kidding me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.22,0:23:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}FN-2187回来后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}FN-2187 reported to my division…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.20,0:23:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已完成了对他的评估并准备将重新训练{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was evaluated, and sent to reconditioning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.54,0:23:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之前没有不符规矩的征兆吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No prior signs of nonconformity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.87,0:23:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是他第一次进攻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was his first offense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.00,0:23:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.09,0:23:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他们被击中了 - 剿灭了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They've been hit. - Destroyed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.73,0:23:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已丧失战斗力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disabled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.88,0:23:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们往贾库去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were headed back to Jakku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.54,0:23:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}CIS推断坠机发生在戈亚逊石漠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fighter is projected to crash in the Goazon badlands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.79,0:24:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们回去找机器人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were going back for the droid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.47,0:24:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}派出小队去往残骸处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send a squad to the wreckage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.74,0:24:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.25,0:24:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.37,0:24:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.88,0:24:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波 我来救你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poe! I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.55,0:24:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.39,0:24:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.64,0:26:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最高领袖斯诺克的命令很明确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supreme Leader Snoke was explicit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.02,0:26:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽可能活捉机器人 如果情况紧急 就摧毁它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capture the droid if we can, but destroy it if we must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.70,0:26:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将军 你的士兵有多少能耐呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How capable are your soldiers, General?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.56,0:26:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会让你质疑我的方法的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't have you question my methods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.37,0:26:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们在犯叛国罪方面显然训练有素{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're obviously skilled at committing high treason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.36,0:26:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许斯诺克领袖应该考虑下使用克隆人军队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps Leader Snoke should consider using a clone army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.85,0:26:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的士兵都是经过特殊训练的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men are exceptionally trained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.29,0:26:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自出生起就按照预定步骤进行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Programmed from birth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.49,0:26:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么他们就完全可以找回机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they should have no problem retrieving the droid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.16,0:26:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且是毫发无损{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unharmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.95,0:26:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心点 伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, Ren, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.33,0:26:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的个人兴趣 妨碍了领袖斯诺克命令的执行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your personal interests not interfere with orders from Leader Snoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.83,0:26:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想要那张地图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.34,0:26:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为你着想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your sake…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.84,0:26:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我建议你还是想办法找到它吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.04,0:26:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.00,0:26:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.09,0:26:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有水吗 - 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Water. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.57,0:26:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有水吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.38,0:27:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}姑娘 你的机器人 我想要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl, your droid. I want it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.57,0:27:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.02,0:27:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离他远点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi, get off him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.19,0:27:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.24,0:27:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些家伙是什么人哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are those people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.30,0:27:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们为昂卡工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They work for Unkar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.68,0:28:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小姐 那个男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistress! That man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.88,0:28:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.89,0:28:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那边的那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.78,0:28:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 就是他 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Him? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.98,0:28:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他穿着我主人的外套{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is wearing my master's jacket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.90,0:28:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 小贼 你急什么呢 - 啥 小贼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's your hurry, thief? - What? Thief?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.78,0:28:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 你干嘛 - 外套{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, what? - The jacket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.16,0:28:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}机器人说这件外套是你偷的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This droid says you stole it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.62,0:28:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我今天已经过得够糟糕了好不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had a pretty messed up day, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.41,0:28:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你不再指控我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'd appreciate it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.62,0:28:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会十分感谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you stop accusing me of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.95,0:28:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 别这么干了 - 你从哪搞来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ow! Stop it! - Where'd you get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.46,0:28:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是它主人的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belongs to his master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.09,0:28:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波·达默龙的外套 这是他的名字 对不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belonged to Poe Dameron. That was his name, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.22,0:28:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被第一秩序俘虏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was captured by the First Order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.97,0:28:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我帮他逃了出来 然后我们的飞船坠毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I helped him escape, but our ship crashed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.68,0:28:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波没能挺过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poe didn't make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.65,0:29:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我尝试去救他 但没成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to help him. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.99,0:29:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你是抵抗组织的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're with the Resistance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.33,0:29:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显而易见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.83,0:29:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.21,0:29:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是抵抗组织的人 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with the Resistance, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.63,0:29:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是抵抗组织的一员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am with the Resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.88,0:29:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我之前从没见过抵抗组织的战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never met a Resistance fighter before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.84,0:29:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就长我这样 我们的一部分人长这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is what we look like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.39,0:29:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他人长别的样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us. Others look different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.01,0:29:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}BB-8说他在执行一个秘密任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}BB-8 says he's on a secret mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.56,0:29:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他必须返回你们的基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to get back to your base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.18,0:29:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据说他有一份通向天行者卢克所在地的地图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, he has a map that leads to Luke Skywalker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.52,0:29:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有人都想得到它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and everyone's after it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.81,0:29:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天行者卢克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke Skywalker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.06,0:29:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为他是个神话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he was a myth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.56,0:29:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.87,0:30:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你在干什么 - 快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.70,0:30:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟上 BB-8{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, BB-8!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.21,0:30:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 放开我 - 快跑 我们得离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let go of me! - Come on, we gotta move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.84,0:30:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不拉着我的手 我也知道怎么跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how to run without you holding my hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.51,0:30:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}BB-8 跟紧点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}BB-8, stay close!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.38,0:30:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}往这走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.18,0:30:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请求空中支援{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call in the air strike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.23,0:30:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.23,0:30:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}咱们俩都是他们的目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're shooting at both of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.56,0:30:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们看见你跟我在一起 你已经被标记了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. They saw you with me. You're marked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.57,0:30:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那不还是拜你所赐 - 嗨！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, thanks for that. - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.07,0:30:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直接用棍子把人抡倒可不是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the one who chased you down with a stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.19,0:30:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这儿的人就没有爆能枪吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anyone have blasters around here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.78,0:30:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.87,0:30:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别抓我的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop taking my hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.60,0:31:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.89,0:31:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没事吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.94,0:31:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.61,0:31:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.28,0:31:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们跑不过他们 - 可以的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can't outrun them! - We might…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.62,0:31:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用那辆四跃飞船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that quadjumper!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.00,0:31:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 我们需要一个飞行员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we need a pilot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.46,0:31:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经有了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.12,0:31:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.79,0:31:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那艘飞船怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what about that ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.84,0:31:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那艘是垃圾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one's garbage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.80,0:31:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死马当活马医吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The garbage will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.15,0:31:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}射击手的位置在那下面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunner position is down there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.11,0:32:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你驾驶过这飞船吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever fly this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.87,0:32:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 这飞船已经很多年没被使用过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! This ship hasn't flown in years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.16,0:32:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.21,0:32:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能行的 我能做到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this. I can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.21,0:32:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能行的 我能做到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this. I can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.03,0:32:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.37,0:32:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.50,0:32:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 保持低空飞行 低空飞行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, stay low! Hey, stay low!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.21,0:32:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么 - 贴地飞行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Stay low!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.37,0:32:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}扰乱他们的追踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It confuses their tracking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.96,0:32:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- BB-8 坐稳了 - 为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- BB-8, hold on! - Whyee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.04,0:32:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要往下冲了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going low!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.06,0:33:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在后头干什么呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing back there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.40,0:33:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还不还击 你在等什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ever gonna fire back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.73,0:33:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在想办法 保护罩打开了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working on it! Are the shields up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.90,0:33:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有副驾驶员协助 我没那么轻松{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so easy without a co-pilot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.74,0:33:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你应该试试坐在这玩意儿上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try sitting in this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.92,0:33:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要掩护 立刻马上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need cover, quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.42,0:33:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马上就会有了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're about to get some!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.80,0:33:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望如愿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.70,0:34:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.17,0:34:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托 给点力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.80,0:34:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 干得好 - 我现在做射击手还挺厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice shot! - I'm getting pretty good at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.32,0:34:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家快趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.07,0:34:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}机关炮在正前方位置上卡死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the cannon's stuck in forward position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.78,0:34:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无法移动它 你只有甩掉他们才行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't move it. You gotta lose him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.32,0:34:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 做好准备 - 好的 做什么准备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get ready! - Okay. For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.63,0:35:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们真要这么做吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we really doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.18,0:35:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.35,0:35:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 刚才的飞行真厉害 - 射得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice shooting. - Now that was some flying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.93,0:35:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 谢谢 - 你是怎么做到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - How did you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.02,0:35:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我也不知道 - 没人训练过你吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - No one trained you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.39,0:35:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我还从来没飞离过星球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've flown some ships, but I've never left the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.23,0:36:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你的最后一击太棒了 - 那简直无与伦比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your last shot was dead-on. - That was amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.48,0:36:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你打爆了他们 - 多亏了你的好助攻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got him with one blast! - You set me up for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.90,0:36:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 简直是完美 - 确实很不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was perfect. - That was pretty good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.90,0:36:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很安全 他是抵抗组织的一员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay. He's with the Resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.28,0:36:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会带你回家的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna get you home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.03,0:36:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.87,0:36:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道你的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.96,0:36:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芬恩 你叫什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn. What's yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.80,0:36:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是蕾伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Rey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.78,0:36:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.60,0:36:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来帮我处理这个 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me with this. Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.97,0:36:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生什么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.61,0:36:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.86,0:36:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们没能在贾库星抓捕到那个机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were unable to acquire the droid on Jakku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.95,0:36:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他乘坐一艘被盗的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It escaped capture…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.20,0:36:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}科瑞利安YT型号运输舰逃脱了追捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}aboard a stolen Corellian YT model freighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.33,0:37:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The droid…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.50,0:37:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偷走了一艘运输舰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}stole a freighter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.25,0:37:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非如此 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.29,0:37:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有帮手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.92,0:37:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然还未经证实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no confirmation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.13,0:37:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们怀疑是FN-2187协助了他逃离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we believe FN-2187 may have helped in the escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.86,0:37:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有别的情况吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.74,0:37:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与他们二人同行的还有一个女子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two were accompanied by a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.58,0:37:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么女子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.04,0:37:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是动力源的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the motivator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.21,0:37:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我一把哈里斯扳手 在那找找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab me a Harris wrench, check in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.80,0:37:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}情况有多糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How bad is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.88,0:37:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们还想靠它活下去的话 不太好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we wanna live, not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.46,0:37:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们现在还在追捕我们 我们必须得离开这个星系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're hunting for us now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.72,0:37:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须得离开这个星系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've gotta get out of this system!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.01,0:37:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}BB-8说抵抗组织基地的位置 只有内部人员知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}BB-8 said the location of the Resistance base is "need to know".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.68,0:38:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我要带你们去那的话 我需要知道那个地点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm taking you there, I need to know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.63,0:38:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.21,0:38:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得告诉我们你的基地在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta tell us where your base is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.56,0:38:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么 不行 - 我不会说你这门语言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? No. - I don't speak that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.23,0:38:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我只告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, between us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.07,0:38:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是抵抗组织的人 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not with the Resistance, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.53,0:38:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是想逃离第一秩序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to get away from the First Order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.19,0:38:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过如果你告诉我基地在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you tell us where the base is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.03,0:38:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就把你先送到那去 成交吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you there first. Deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.53,0:38:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 机器人 拜托 - 派莱克斯扳手 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Droid, please! - Pilex driver, hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.16,0:38:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 所以你们的基地在哪儿 - 好的 BB-8 告诉她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, where's your base? - Go on, BB-8, tell her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.56,0:38:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.04,0:38:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 伊利尼姆星系 - 对 伊利尼姆星系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The lleenium system? - Yeah, the lleenium system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.05,0:38:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是那 把我们送到那去 越快越好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the one. Get us there as fast as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.05,0:38:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会把你们两个仍在波尼马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll drop you two at Ponemah Terminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.55,0:38:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要发动机胶带 赶紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the bonding tape, hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.72,0:38:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要去哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.89,0:38:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须得回贾库星去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get back to Jakku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.22,0:38:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回贾库{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to Jak…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.36,0:38:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 为什么所有人都想回到贾库星 - 那个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why does everyone wanna go back to Jakku? - That place is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.91,0:38:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不对 不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.52,0:38:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我手指的那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one I'm pointing to. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.48,0:38:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不对 不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.20,0:38:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们不把漏气的地方补上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't patch it up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.32,0:38:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}燃料箱就会泄露{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the propulsion tank will overflow…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.78,0:38:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有毒气体会充满整艘飞船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and flood the ship with poisonous gas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.27,0:38:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这个 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.65,0:38:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 蕾伊 你是一位飞行员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rey, you're a pilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.57,0:38:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想飞去哪儿都行 为什么要回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can fly anywhere. Why go back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.57,0:38:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有家人在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.95,0:39:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是男朋友在那里 一个帅哥男友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a boyfriend? A cute boyfriend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.20,0:39:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原因就是 关你屁事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of your business, that's why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.08,0:39:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 准没什么好事 - 去驾驶舱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That can't be good. - No, it can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.42,0:39:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们被人跟踪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's locked on to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.55,0:39:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有控制系统都被改写了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All controls are overridden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.89,0:39:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}起开 别碰我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off! Get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.35,0:39:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看见什么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.81,0:39:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.07,0:39:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是第一秩序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the First Order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.15,0:39:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要怎么办 肯定有什么对策{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do? There must be something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.74,0:39:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你刚刚说有有毒气体 - 我已经堵上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said poisonous gas. - I fixed that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.49,0:39:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能再把它打开吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you unfix it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.29,0:39:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来 BB-8{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, BB-8.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.25,0:39:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我接住他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.25,0:39:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.84,0:39:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}BB8 快挪开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}BB-8, get off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.26,0:40:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得这招对帝国冲锋队员有用吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think this will work on the stormtroopers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.01,0:40:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有用 他们的面具可以过滤烟雾但不防毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Their masks filter out smoke, not toxins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.94,0:40:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 快点 - 我在快了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry. - I'm hurrying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.20,0:40:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丘伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.71,0:40:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.97,0:40:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他人在哪儿 飞行员呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.22,0:40:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 哪里有飞行员 - 我就是飞行员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the pilot? - I'm the pilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.89,0:40:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你 - 她在撒谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You? - She's lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.44,0:40:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 是真的 飞船上只有我们几个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's true. We're the only ones on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.48,0:40:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能听懂这玩意儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can understand that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.02,0:40:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这玩意儿也能听得懂你说话 所以注意你的用词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And "that thing" can understand you, too… so watch it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.07,0:40:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快从那出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.99,0:41:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你从哪里得到的这艘飞船 - 尼伊马贸易哨站{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd you get this ship? - Niima Outpost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.99,0:41:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贾库星 那个垃圾场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jakku? That junkyard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.62,0:41:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 就是个垃圾场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you! Junkyard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.91,0:41:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跟你说过我们应该再搜索一遍西境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you we should have double-checked the Western Reaches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.33,0:41:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它在谁手里 杜凯恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who had it? Ducain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.91,0:41:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我偷了它 从昂卡·普拉特那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stole it. From Unkar Plutt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.83,0:41:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他从欧文兄弟那偷的 欧文兄弟是从杜凯恩那偷的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stole it from the Irving Boys, who stole it from Ducain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.17,0:41:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他偷的我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who stole it from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.54,0:41:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你告诉他汉·索洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you tell him that Han Solo…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.05,0:41:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如今又把千年隼偷回来了 不会再丢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just stole back the Millennium Falcon for good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.55,0:41:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这艘船是千年隼号 你是汉·索洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Millennium Falcon? You're Han Solo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.05,0:41:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾经是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.26,0:41:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汉·索洛 那个义军将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han Solo, the Rebellion general?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.81,0:41:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 是走私犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the smuggler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.50,0:41:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不是个战斗英雄吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't he a war hero?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.18,0:41:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是那艘只用十四秒差距完成科舍尔航程的飞船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the ship that made the Kessel Run in 14 parsecs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.60,0:41:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十二秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.94,0:41:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么十四秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fourteen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.75,0:41:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.42,0:41:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个穆夫牛挤奶工在点火线上装了个压缩机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some moof-milker put a compressor on the ignition line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.50,0:41:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昂卡·普拉特做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unkar Plutt did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.67,0:42:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也觉得这是个错误 把太多压力留给了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was a mistake, too. Puts too much…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.13,0:42:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 超光速推进器 - 超光速推进器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …stress on the hyperdrive. - stress on the hyperdrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.47,0:42:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丘伊 把他们扔到飞行舱里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, throw them in a pod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.05,0:42:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一会儿把他们放到最近的无人星上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll drop them at the nearest inhabited planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.61,0:42:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.81,0:42:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们需要你的帮助 - 我的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need your help. - My help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.31,0:42:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个机器人必须赶到抵抗组织基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This droid has to get to the Resistance base…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.94,0:42:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as soon as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.94,0:42:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他携带着一份通向天行者卢克所在地的地图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's carrying a map to Luke Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.82,0:42:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是大名鼎鼎的汉·索洛 和义军并肩作战过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the Han Solo that fought with the Rebellion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.83,0:42:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你肯定知道他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.17,0:42:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我知道他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I knew him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.38,0:42:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认识卢克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.80,0:42:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别告诉我有一只拉思塔逃跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me a Rathtar's gotten loose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.76,0:42:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.68,0:42:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你刚刚是说了拉思塔吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just say Rathtars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.10,0:42:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.18,0:42:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不是在用这艘运输舰走私拉思塔吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not hauling Rathtars on this freighter, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.27,0:42:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是在运送拉思塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hauling Rathtars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.56,0:43:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瓜维亚死亡帮来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great. It's the Guavian Death Gang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.86,0:43:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们一定是从南图区域就开始追踪我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have tracked us from Nantoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.93,0:43:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉思塔是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a Rathtar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.32,0:43:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们体型很大并且很危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're big and they're dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.90,0:43:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听说过特里利亚大屠杀吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever heard of the Trillia Massacre?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.53,0:43:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没有 - 挺好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.66,0:43:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要送三只到普拉纳国王去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got three of them going to King Prana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.62,0:43:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三只 你是怎么把它们弄上船的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three? How'd you get them on board?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.04,0:43:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们之前人手更多些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to have a bigger crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.33,0:43:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到下面去 我让你们上来再上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get below and stay there until I say so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.34,0:43:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别打飞船的主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and don't even think about taking the Falcon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.00,0:43:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}BB-8怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about BB-8?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.09,0:43:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我甩掉这帮人之前 他跟着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stays with me until I get rid of the gang…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.88,0:43:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后你们就可以带着他 爱去哪儿去哪儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you can have him back and be on your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.51,0:43:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那拉思塔怎么办 你把它们放在哪儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the Rathtars? Where are you keeping them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.89,0:43:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那有一只 - 你打算做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's one. - What are you gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.01,0:43:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老样子 按我的方式解决问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same thing I always do. Talk my way out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.39,0:43:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有成功过吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.64,0:43:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 次次管用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do. Every time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.16,0:43:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汉·索洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han Solo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.25,0:43:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a dead man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.83,0:44:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}巴拉-蒂克 有什么问题吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bala-Tik. What's the problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.75,0:44:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们借了你50000块干这趟活儿 这就是问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problem is we loaned you 50, 000 for this job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.59,0:44:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你能看见他们吗 - 看不见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you see them? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.22,0:44:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说你也向坎吉俱乐部借了50000块{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you also borrowed 50, 000 from Kanjiklub.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.43,0:44:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道的 那些小怪物不可信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you can't trust those little freaks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.22,0:44:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}咱们都认识多久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long we known each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.72,0:44:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们有爆能枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have blasters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.89,0:44:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.06,0:44:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}时间不长 我们现在想要回那笔钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not long. We want our money back now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.36,0:44:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得捕捉拉思塔很便宜吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think hunting Rathtars is cheap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.44,0:44:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那钱我已经花了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent that money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.69,0:44:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坎吉俱乐部也想要回他们的资金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kanjiklub wants their investment back, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.24,0:44:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从没和坎吉俱乐部做过交易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never made a deal with Kanjiklub!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.61,0:44:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这话你自己跟坎吉俱乐部说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell that 110 Kanjiklub.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.79,0:44:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}塔苏·利奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tasu Leech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.09,0:44:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴见到你啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.93,0:44:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兄弟们 我答应好的东西我会给你们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys, you're both gonna get what I promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.02,0:44:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我有言而无信过吗 - 有啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have I ever not delivered…for you before? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.27,0:45:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 第二次是什么事 - 故技重施{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was the second time? - Your game is old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.40,0:45:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这个星系里不会有人再相信你的骗局了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one in the galaxy left for you to swindle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.57,0:45:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个BB机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That BB unit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.66,0:45:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一秩序正在找的那个机器人 跟它一模一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The First Order is looking for one just like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.00,0:45:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有两个逃犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And two fugitives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.17,0:45:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事我第一次听说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First I've heard of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.13,0:45:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.47,0:45:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们可以把走廊上的防爆门关上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we close the blast doors in that corridor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.64,0:45:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就能把那两帮的人困住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can trap both gangs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.85,0:45:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从这里把门关上吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll close the blast doors from here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.39,0:45:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}重置下保险丝应该就能行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resetting the fuses should do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.15,0:45:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有种不好的预感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a bad feeling about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.03,0:45:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 惨了 - 什么惨了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no. - "Oh, no, " what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.12,0:45:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找错保险丝了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong fuses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.20,0:45:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀了他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.49,0:45:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 哇 - 抓住那个机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa… - And take the droid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.52,0:46:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这是个错误的决定 - 犯大错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This was a mistake! - Huge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.58,0:46:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们长什么样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they look like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.54,0:46:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就长那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They look like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.80,0:46:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 往这走 - 你确定吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This way. - Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.55,0:46:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.76,0:46:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芬恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.14,0:47:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芬恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.39,0:47:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.56,0:47:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别碰我 别碰我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Off! Get Off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.37,0:47:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芬恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.82,0:47:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芬恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.57,0:47:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放开我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.92,0:47:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.73,0:47:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}滚开 滚开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off! Get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.69,0:47:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芬恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.93,0:47:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 它抓住我了 但是那门 - 真是幸运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- it had me! But the door… - That was lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.31,0:47:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来开门 掩护我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the door. Cover us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.48,0:48:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丘伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.20,0:48:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 还好吗 - 还好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.95,0:48:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.17,0:48:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.13,0:48:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.22,0:48:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你 把门关上 你 照顾丘伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, close the door behind us. You, take care of Chewie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.14,0:48:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.48,0:48:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昂卡·普拉特在这安装了一个燃油泵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unkar Plutt installed a fuel pump, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.23,0:48:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不把它填装好 我们哪也去不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't prime that, we're not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.15,0:48:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恨他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate that guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.44,0:48:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你以前还有副驾驶 - 有一个 现在在后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you could use a co-pilot. - I got one, he's back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.40,0:48:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看着推进器 我们要以光速离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the thrust. We're going out of here at lightspeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.49,0:48:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从吊舱内部 这可能吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From inside the hangar? Is that even possible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.37,0:48:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都是在做完了才问这个问题的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never ask that question till after I've done it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.87,0:48:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可不是我想象中的一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not how I thought this day was gonna go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.12,0:48:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打开防护盾 后面的人坐好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angle the shield. Hang on back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.17,0:48:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.26,0:49:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托 宝贝 别让我失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby, don't let me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.06,0:49:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么来着 - 压缩机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Compressor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.52,0:49:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通知第一秩序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inform the First Order…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.82,0:49:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们要的机器人在汉·索洛手里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Han Solo has the droid they want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.74,0:49:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它在千年隼号上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's aboard the Millennium Falcon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.66,0:49:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个机器人很快会被送到抵抗组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The droid will soon be delivered to the Resistance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.25,0:49:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带他们找到最后一个绝地武士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}leading them to the last Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.26,0:49:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果天行者回归{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Skywalker returns…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.55,0:49:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新一代绝地武士就会崛起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the new Jedi will rise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.73,0:49:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最高领袖 我会负起全责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supreme Leader, I take full responsibility…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.39,0:49:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.27,0:49:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须要改变战略了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our strategy must now change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.19,0:50:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}武器已经准备就绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The weapon. it is ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.36,0:50:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信是时候派上用场了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe the time has come to use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.74,0:50:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们将摧毁支持抵抗组织的政府{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall destroy the government that supports the Resistance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.62,0:50:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}共和国政府{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.41,0:50:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有了朋友的支持{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without their friends to protect them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.04,0:50:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抵抗组织就会变得力量薄弱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Resistance will be vulnerable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.87,0:50:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他们找到天行者之前拦截他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will stop them before they reach Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.87,0:50:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.92,0:50:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}监督好准备工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oversee preparations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.42,0:50:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 最高领袖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Supreme Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.05,0:50:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个人已经觉醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has been an awakening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.14,0:50:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你感觉到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you felt it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.43,0:50:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.85,0:50:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有更多的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.02,0:50:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要找的机器人在千年隼号上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The droid we seek is aboard the Millennium Falcon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.99,0:50:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你父亲手中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the hands of your father…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.95,0:50:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汉·索洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han Solo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.41,0:50:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对我而言毫无意义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He means nothing to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.91,0:50:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便是你 伦武士团的大师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even you, master of the Knights of Ren…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.34,0:51:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也从未面临过如此挑战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have never faced such a test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.42,0:51:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}承蒙您的培养 我不会受此诱惑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the grace of your training, I will not be seduced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.76,0:51:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们拭目以待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.18,0:51:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们拭目以待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.11,0:51:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 电力超负荷了 - 我能修好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Electrical overload. - I can fix that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.44,0:51:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冷却剂泄露了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coolant's leaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.03,0:51:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尝试把辅助电力转移到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try transferring auxiliary power…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.41,0:51:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 第二燃料箱 - 第二燃料箱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …to the secondary tank. - to the secondary tank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.87,0:51:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.58,0:51:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丘伊 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.83,0:51:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要帮忙制住这个大毛怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need help with this giant hairy thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.50,0:51:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 来了 - 别过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop moving! - Stop moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.54,0:51:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 丘伊 - 他需要帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chewie! - He needs help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.46,0:51:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要是伤害丘伊 就是和我作对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hurt Chewie, you're gonna deal with me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.30,0:51:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伤害他 他几乎杀了我六次了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurt him? He almost killed me six times!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.01,0:51:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这下好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is fine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.14,0:51:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果超光速引擎爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This hyperdrive blows, there are gonna be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.68,0:51:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们将会变成三个不同星系的碎片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}pieces of us in three different systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.02,0:51:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.06,0:51:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我绕开了压缩机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bypassed the compressor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.31,0:52:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.57,0:52:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走开 圆球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, ball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.03,0:52:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别那么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, don't say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.20,0:52:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做得很棒 休息一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did great. Just rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.79,0:52:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做得好 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.33,0:52:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.87,0:52:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.92,0:52:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.46,0:52:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是逃犯 哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}fugitives, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.72,0:52:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一秩序想要那张地图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The First Order wants the map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.09,0:52:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芬恩是抵抗组织成员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn is with the Resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.01,0:52:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是一个拾荒者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a scavenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.47,0:52:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们看看你拿到了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what you got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.35,0:52:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 可以吗 - 给他看吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should I? - Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.66,0:52:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这张地图并不完整 只是其中一张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This map's not complete. It's just a piece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.53,0:52:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自从卢克失踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since Luke disappeared…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.45,0:52:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人们就一直在找他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}people have been looking for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.54,0:52:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他为什么离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did he leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.25,0:53:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他曾经培养了新一代绝地武士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was training a new generation of Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.08,0:53:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个男孩 他的徒弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One boy, an apprentice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.84,0:53:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}背叛了他 摧毁了一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}turned against him, destroyed it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.71,0:53:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢克感到很自责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke felt responsible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.72,0:53:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只好远离一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just walked away from everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.93,0:53:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道在他身上发生过什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what happened to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.55,0:53:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有很多谣言和传说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of rumors. Stories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.93,0:53:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}了解他的人猜测{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People that knew him best…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.65,0:53:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他去寻找第一绝地圣殿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}think he went looking for the first Jedi temple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.78,0:53:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝地武士真的存在吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Jedi were real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.19,0:53:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾经也怀疑过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to wonder about that myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.49,0:53:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也曾认为只是一堆胡言乱语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought it was a bunch of mumbo-jumbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.57,0:53:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结合正义与邪恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A magical power holding together good and evil…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.24,0:53:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑暗和光明的神奇力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dark side and the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.75,0:53:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}疯狂的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy thing is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.71,0:53:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.30,0:53:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原力 绝地武士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Force. The Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.51,0:53:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.76,0:53:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.19,0:54:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 你去休息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.37,0:54:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想要我帮忙 那你要听我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want my help? You're getting it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.44,0:54:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去见一个老朋友 她会帮你的机器人回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna see an old friend. She'll get your droid home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.78,0:54:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.50,0:54:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道银河系中居然还有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know there was this much green…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.09,0:54:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么多绿色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the whole galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.37,0:55:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 索洛 我不知道我们来这干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Solo, I'm not sure what we're walking into here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.54,0:55:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你刚刚叫我索洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just call me Solo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.25,0:55:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 汉·索洛先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Han. Mr. Solo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.96,0:55:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.12,0:55:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可是抵抗组织的大人物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a big deal in the Resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.59,0:55:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们真正目标是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which puts a real target on my back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.05,0:55:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里有任何阴谋者吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any conspirators here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.71,0:55:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像是第一秩序支持者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, First Order sympathizers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.72,0:55:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 「大人物」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Big Deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.47,0:55:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有其他问题要解决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got another problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.47,0:55:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女人总是能找出真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women always figure out the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.22,0:55:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.57,0:55:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会需要这个的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might need this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.23,0:55:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我自己能搞定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I can handle myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.03,0:55:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 这就是我为什么把它给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you do. That's why I'm giving it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.24,0:55:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.08,0:55:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道怎么使用吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how to use one of those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.33,0:55:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道 扣动扳机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You pull the trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.08,0:55:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上远远不止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little bit more to it than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.41,0:55:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}学无止境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a lot to learn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.50,0:55:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你叫什么名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.67,0:55:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.38,0:55:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.26,0:56:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直想发展一些船员 蕾伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I been thinking about bringing on some more crew, Rey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.76,0:56:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个二副 能帮上忙的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A second mate. Someone to help out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.81,0:56:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能和丘伊和我保持步调一致{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who can keep up with Chewie and me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.52,0:56:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能赏识千年隼号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}appreciates the Falcon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.23,0:56:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在给我提供工作吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you offering me a job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.10,0:56:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对你不会很好 也不会付很多钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be nice to you. Doesn't pay much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.73,0:56:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在招募我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're offering me a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.78,0:56:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正在考虑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.95,0:56:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.62,0:56:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这么说我真是受宠若惊 但我必须回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were, I'd be flattered. But I have to get home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.21,0:56:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回哪儿 贾库{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where, Jakku?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.29,0:56:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经离开太久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already been away too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.80,0:56:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丘伊 好好检查一下飞船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, check out the ship as best you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.88,0:56:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那真遗憾 丘伊有点喜欢你呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's too bad. Chewie kind of likes you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.89,0:56:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}索洛 我们来这干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solo, why are we here again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.68,0:56:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确保你的机器人能在一艘安全的船上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get your droid on a clean ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.31,0:56:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.35,0:56:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得我和丘伊找到千年隼号是运气使然吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it was luck that Chewie and I found the Falcon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.90,0:56:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们能在扫描仪上找到它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can find it on our scanners…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.53,0:56:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一秩序也离我们不远了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the First Order's not far behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.99,0:57:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想把BB-8送回抵抗组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna get BB-8 to the Resistance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.86,0:57:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛兹·卡纳塔就是我们最好选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maz Kanata's our best bet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.58,0:57:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们能相信她吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can trust her, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.16,0:57:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放心 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.83,0:57:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她开这个酒馆一千多年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's run this watering hole for a thousand years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.25,0:57:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛兹有点古怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maz is a bit of an acquired taste…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.38,0:57:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以由我来跟她谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let me do the talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.84,0:57:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论你们做什么 别盯着看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whatever you do, don't stare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.67,0:57:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 看什么 - 看什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- At what? - At what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.76,0:57:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.03,0:57:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汉·索洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han Solo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.20,0:57:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 老天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.58,0:57:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 玛兹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Maz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.58,0:57:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的男朋友呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my boyfriend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.04,0:57:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丘伊在千年隼号上工作呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie's working on the Falcon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.75,0:57:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜欢那个伍基人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like that Wookiee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.55,0:58:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜你要一些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume you need something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.59,0:58:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}急需{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desperately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.09,0:58:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.65,0:59:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原谅我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.78,0:59:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我又一次感受到它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.12,0:59:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把我拉向光明的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pull to the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.49,0:59:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最高领袖察觉到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supreme Leader senses it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.08,0:59:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请再次给我展示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.96,0:59:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑暗的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power of the darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.42,0:59:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我绝不会让任何事情阻挡我们的道路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will let nothing stand in our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.97,0:59:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我展示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.51,0:59:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}外公{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandfather…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.31,0:59:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会完成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I Will finish…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.77,0:59:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你未尽的事业的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.48,0:59:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一张能找到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.99,0:59:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天行者的地图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Skywalker himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.69,0:59:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你打算重出江湖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are right back in the mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.04,0:59:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛兹 我需要你把这个机器人送到莱娅那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maz, I need you to get this droid to Leia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.46,1:00:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.84,1:00:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经远离这场战斗太久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been running away from this fight for too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.34,1:00:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.01,1:00:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回家吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.18,1:00:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莱娅不会想见我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leia doesn't wanna see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.56,1:00:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托 我们来这就是寻求你的帮助的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, we came here for your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.02,1:00:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What fight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.23,1:00:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唯一的一场战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.36,1:00:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抵抗黑暗组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.61,1:00:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}古往今来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through the ages…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.03,1:00:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经见识过太多的邪恶力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen evil take many forms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.24,1:00:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}西斯人 帝国军团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sith. The Empire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.53,1:00:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 是第一秩序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, it is the First Order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.66,1:00:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们的阴影遍布整个银河系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their shadow is spreading across the galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.71,1:00:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须面对他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must face them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.21,1:00:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和他们战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.38,1:00:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们所有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.55,1:00:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能和第一秩序对抗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no fight against the First Order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.21,1:00:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不可能战胜他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not one we can win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.55,1:00:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看周围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.88,1:00:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没机会了 我们早已被认出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no chance we haven't been recognized already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.39,1:00:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我敢打赌第一秩序已经在来的路上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you the First Order is on their way right…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.89,1:00:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.73,1:01:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.44,1:01:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}索洛 她在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solo, what is she doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.07,1:01:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 但肯定不是好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. But it ain't good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.99,1:01:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你活得够久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you live long enough…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.86,1:01:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就能通过眼睛能看透不同的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you see the same eyes in different people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.28,1:01:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到了一个想要逃跑的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking at the eyes of a man who wants to run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.62,1:01:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对我一无所知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know a thing about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.92,1:01:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从哪来 见过什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I'm from. What I've seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.59,1:01:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没人比我更了解第一秩序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know the First Order like I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.22,1:01:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们会把我们屠杀殆尽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll slaughter us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.47,1:01:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都要逃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all need to run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.06,1:01:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到那两个人了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see those two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.77,1:01:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们会把货物运往{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll trade work for transportation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.53,1:01:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}外环星域交易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the Outer Rim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.03,1:01:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那 你可以消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, you can disappear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.45,1:01:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芬恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.87,1:01:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我一起走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.91,1:02:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}BB-8怎么办 我们还没有完成任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about BB-8? We're not done yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.04,1:02:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得把它送回你们基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get him back to your base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.11,1:02:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以为呢 他不行的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think? He can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.79,1:02:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.93,1:02:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}留着吧 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.40,1:02:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个女孩是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.20,1:02:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么 这是什么 - 让他先说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? What is it? - Let him speak first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.78,1:02:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人说你们可以把我带到外环星域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was told you can get me to the Outer Rim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.82,1:02:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.66,1:02:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别丢下我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave without me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.50,1:02:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能一走了之 我不会让你走的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just go. I won't let you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.42,1:02:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是你想的那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not who you think I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.59,1:02:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芬恩 你在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, what are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.75,1:02:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是抵抗组织的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.51,1:02:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.26,1:02:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是一个风暴兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a stormtrooper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.18,1:03:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和他们一样 我从一个永远都不会知道的家庭被带走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like all of them, I was taken from a family I'll never know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.85,1:03:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被培养训练去杀戮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And raised to do one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.56,1:03:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我第一场战斗中 我做了一个选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my first battle, I made a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.86,1:03:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想杀他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't gonna kill for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.36,1:03:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我逃跑了 正好遇见了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I ran. Right into you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.86,1:03:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从来没有人像你那样看我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you looked at me like no one ever had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.87,1:03:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为自己感到羞耻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was ashamed of what I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.71,1:03:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 我受够了第一秩序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm done with the First Order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.83,1:03:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我永远都不要回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never going back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.71,1:03:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾伊 跟我一起走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey, come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.55,1:03:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.97,1:03:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}照顾好自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.52,1:03:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.91,1:04:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.08,1:04:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.55,1:04:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别走 回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.43,1:04:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.64,1:04:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.28,1:04:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.46,1:04:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.26,1:05:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.18,1:05:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的能量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its energy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.52,1:05:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 包围着我们 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …surrounds us… - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.69,1:05:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蒙蔽着我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and binds us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.86,1:06:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原力会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Force Will be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.04,1:06:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.67,1:06:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.67,1:06:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安静 小丫头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet, girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.05,1:06:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.64,1:06:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.23,1:06:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你成为绝地武士的第一步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are your first steps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.90,1:06:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刚才那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.15,1:06:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不该贸然进来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have gone in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.12,1:06:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是卢克的光剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That lightsaber was Luke's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.66,1:06:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那之前属于他父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his father's before him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.58,1:06:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 它属于你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, it calls to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.33,1:06:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须要回贾库{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get back to Jakku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.42,1:06:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汉跟我说了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.84,1:07:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.97,1:07:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从你的眼睛里看出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.10,1:07:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经知道真相了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already know the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.18,1:07:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在贾库等待的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whomever you're waiting for on Jakku…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.94,1:07:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们再也不会回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're never coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.99,1:07:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.20,1:07:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个人例外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's someone who still could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.33,1:07:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.00,1:07:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你苦苦追寻的归宿不在过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The belonging you seek is not behind you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.79,1:07:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而在未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.58,1:07:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是绝地武士 但我了解原力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am no Jedi, but I know the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.25,1:07:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它会在生命体之间存在与流动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It moves through and surrounds every living thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.26,1:07:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}闭上眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.14,1:07:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用心感受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.43,1:07:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}光明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The light…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.64,1:08:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无处不在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's always been there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.15,1:08:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它会指引你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will guide you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.28,1:08:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿上那把光剑吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The saber. Take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.32,1:08:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我绝不会再碰它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never touching that thing again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.37,1:08:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想牵扯进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want any part of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.35,1:08:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天是共和国的末日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today is the end of the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.86,1:08:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是无秩序政权终结的日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The end of a regime that acquiesces to disorder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.66,1:08:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这个特别的时刻 地处遥远星系的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this very moment, in a system far from here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.87,1:09:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新共和国欺骗了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the New Republic lies to the galaxy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.78,1:09:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}秘密支持{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}while secretly supporting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.43,1:09:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抵抗组织的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the treachery{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.12,1:09:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谋反行为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the rogues of the Resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.49,1:09:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们将用脚下这个你们亲手建造的毁灭性武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This fierce machine which you have built, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.08,1:09:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将共和国和他们视为珍宝的舰队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon which we stand will bring an end to the Senate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.75,1:09:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}送上西天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to their cherished fleet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.56,1:09:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其余的星系将永远臣服于第一秩序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All remaining systems will bow to the First Order!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.11,1:09:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且将永远铭记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And will remember this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.73,1:09:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}共和国灭亡的今天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the last day of the Republic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.57,1:09:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人工控制授权确认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirm transfer to manual control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.79,1:09:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}配置完成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Configure!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.45,1:09:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.97,1:10:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天哪 这是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.66,1:10:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是新共和国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.99,1:11:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是第一秩序干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The First Order, they've done it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.00,1:11:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾伊去哪儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Rey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.12,1:11:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小姐 你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistress, are you alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.49,1:11:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.76,1:11:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看见你一直在跑 你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you running, are you alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.80,1:11:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你快回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.08,1:11:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你去哪里 - 我要走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - I'm leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.92,1:11:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- BB-8 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- BB-8… - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.44,1:11:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.61,1:11:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须得回去 你太重要了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to go back, you're too important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.86,1:11:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们会帮助你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.71,1:11:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经保管了很久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had this for ages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.05,1:11:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直把它锁在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kept it locked away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.84,1:11:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从哪儿得到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you get that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.14,1:12:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问得好 改天给你解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good question. For another time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.22,1:12:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.39,1:12:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到你的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find your friend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.07,1:12:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那群畜生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those beasts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.20,1:12:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们打过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.10,1:12:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}FN-417 站在别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}FN-417, hold position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.09,1:12:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忘了保险栓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.96,1:13:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.13,1:13:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有士兵报告机器人朝西逃走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The droid was spotted heading west.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.55,1:13:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和一个女孩一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.09,1:13:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走 别让他们发现你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to keep going. Stay out of sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.64,1:13:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我负责牵制住他们 - 但愿他们找不到我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll try to fight them off. - I hope they won't find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.56,1:13:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但愿如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.24,1:13:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟上 丘伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Chewie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.58,1:13:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾伊和BB-8 他们需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey and BB-8! They need you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.66,1:13:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.75,1:13:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要一件武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a weapon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.17,1:13:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你手上不就是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.01,1:14:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个借我用用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can I try that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.19,1:14:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.61,1:14:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叛徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.66,1:15:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你没事吧 「大人物」 - 多谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay, Big Deal? - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.57,1:15:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不许动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.83,1:15:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}TK-338 我们已经包围了目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}TK-338, we have targets in custody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.75,1:15:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}28.6公里外敌军来袭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have incoming at 28.6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.09,1:15:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前进 前进 前进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.09,1:15:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有人集合 重复 所有人集合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scramble all squads, repeat, scramble all squads!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.18,1:15:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找掩护 守住中心战场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head to higher cover and wait for our position!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.76,1:15:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是抵抗组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.11,1:15:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朝着他们开火 这些暴徒没什么可怕的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go straight at them! Don't let these dogs scare you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.44,1:15:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 收到 - 一起冲 波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Copy that. - We're with you, Poe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.81,1:16:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.75,1:16:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这才是真正的飞行员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one hell of a pilot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.35,1:17:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听过太多关于你的传闻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl I've heard so much about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.66,1:17:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The droid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.85,1:18:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.42,1:18:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们急需空中支援{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Request air support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.18,1:18:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.52,1:18:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经看过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.77,1:18:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长官 抵抗组织派飞机过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, Resistance fighters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.06,1:18:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要更多人手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need more troops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.77,1:18:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全军撤退{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull the division out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.73,1:18:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用找机器人了 我们已经找到目标了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the droid. We have what we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.62,1:18:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}撤退{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull back to tree line!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.30,1:18:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.56,1:19:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.89,1:19:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.65,1:19:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.00,1:19:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他把她带走了 你看见了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took her. Did you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.84,1:19:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她被带走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took her. She's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.34,1:19:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 我知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.85,1:19:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.86,1:20:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天哪 汉·索洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodness! Han Solo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.49,1:20:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还记得我吗 C-3PO{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is I, C-3PO.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.20,1:20:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}换了个红胳膊后你可能不认得我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably don't recognize me… because of the red arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.46,1:20:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快看这是谁 你看见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look who it is, did you see who…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.84,1:20:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恕我无礼 殿下 我错了 将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Prin… General. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.97,1:20:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 走吧 BB-8 他们等着呢 - 你的胳膊真特别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come along, BB-8, quickly. - What an unusual arm you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.38,1:20:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得赶紧换上正确的胳膊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I must get my proper arm reinstalled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.97,1:20:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你换发型了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You changed your hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.06,1:20:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是那件外套{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same jacket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.73,1:20:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 这件是新的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, new jacket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.49,1:20:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看见他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.41,1:20:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莱娅 我看见我们的儿子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leia, I saw our son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.25,1:20:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.33,1:21:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.92,1:21:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的好朋友 BB-8{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}BB-8, my buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.93,1:21:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}见到你真高兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's so good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.97,1:21:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芬恩救了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn saved you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.02,1:21:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.26,1:21:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.16,1:21:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.52,1:21:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波·达默龙 你还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poe Dameron, you're alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.14,1:21:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 兄弟 你也没事 - 你去哪里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Buddy! So are you! - What happened to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.40,1:21:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我被爆炸冲击波震飞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got thrown from the crash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.81,1:21:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在夜里醒来之后 既没看见你 也没看见飞船 什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I woke up at night. No you. No ship. Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.82,1:21:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}BB-8说是你救了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}BB-8 says that you saved him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.32,1:21:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不只是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. It wasn'tjust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.94,1:22:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你替我完成了使命 芬恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You completed my mission, Finn…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.53,1:22:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的外套{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my jacket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.70,1:22:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没错 - 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh… - No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.16,1:22:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}穿着吧 很适合你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it. It suits you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.79,1:22:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芬恩 你是个好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good man, Finn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.45,1:22:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波 我需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poe, I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.96,1:22:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}PZ-4CO 报告通信情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}PZ-4CO, report to communications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.88,1:22:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奥加纳长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Organa…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.72,1:22:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉打搅了 这是芬恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to interrupt. This is Finn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.97,1:22:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他想跟您谈谈 - 正好我也要和他谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He needs to talk to you. - And I need to talk to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.89,1:22:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你所做的一切真是勇气可嘉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was incredibly brave what you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.77,1:22:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}脱离第一秩序 救下这个年轻人的命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renouncing the First Order, saving this man's life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.48,1:22:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您 夫人 但是我的一个朋友被抓走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, ma'am. But a friend of mine was taken prisoner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.48,1:22:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汉跟我说了那个女孩的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han told me about the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.44,1:22:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对此深表遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.69,1:22:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芬恩之前在基地工作过 他熟悉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn's familiar with the weapon that destroyed the Hosnian system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.82,1:22:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摧毁霍斯尼亚星系的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He worked on the base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.32,1:22:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道的一切对我们将会非常重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're desperate for anything you can tell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.36,1:22:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的朋友就被带去那里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where my friend was taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.70,1:22:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得尽快赶过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to get there fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.12,1:22:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我乐意提供一切资源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will do everything I can to help…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.66,1:22:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你得先把知道的都告诉我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but first you need to tell us all you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.87,1:22:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定很痛苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds very scary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.71,1:22:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定很勇敢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be so brave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.67,1:23:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.80,1:23:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很遗憾的通知您{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I regret to inform you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.26,1:23:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从BB-8中读取的地图数据并不完整{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this map recovered from BB-8… is only partially complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.55,1:23:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更糟的是 这部分数据无法和数据库中的任何一副地图匹配{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even worse, it matches no charted system on record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.39,1:23:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还是无法准确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We simply do not have enough information…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.60,1:23:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}定位卢克的位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to locate Master Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.19,1:23:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我太天真了 居然觉得能把卢克带回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't believe I was so foolish to think I could find Luke and bring him home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.40,1:23:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莱娅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.61,1:23:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.78,1:23:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.07,1:23:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么都别做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.61,1:23:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princesses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.62,1:23:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是想帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to be helpful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.33,1:23:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你什么时候帮过忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did that ever help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.49,1:23:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了死星那次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't say the Death Star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.37,1:23:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}R2 我需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.85,1:23:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}R2 醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.77,1:23:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}BB-8{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}BB-8.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.72,1:23:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你在浪费时间 - 他可能有地图数据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're wasting your time. - He might have the map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.68,1:23:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁都不能肯定R2的备份数据里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is very doubtful that R2 would have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.60,1:23:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有剩余的地图信息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the rest of the map in his backup data.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.93,1:23:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们不能把它叫醒吗 - 恐怕不能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can't we wake him? - I am afraid not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.15,1:24:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢克大师走了之后 R2-D2就一直处在低电量模式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2-D2 has been in low-power mode ever since Master Luke went away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.78,1:24:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可能永远都醒不过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly, he may never be his old self again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.47,1:24:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的R2{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.74,1:24:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听我说好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.37,1:24:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道每次你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know every time you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.91,1:24:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每次你看着我 你都会想起他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time you look at me you're reminded of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.38,1:24:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得我能忘掉他吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I want to forget him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.46,1:24:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望他回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want him back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.25,1:24:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个时候我们已经尽力了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing more we could have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.09,1:24:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他身上有太多外祖父的影子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's too much Vader in him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.55,1:24:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我才希望卢克能去训练他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I wanted him to train with Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.55,1:24:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我本不该把他送走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just never should have sent him away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.35,1:24:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从那时候起我就失去了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when I lost him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.18,1:24:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也失去了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when I lost you both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.27,1:24:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只能用各自的方式去弥补这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both had to deal with it in our own way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.94,1:24:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我回去做我唯一擅长的事情了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went back to the only thing I was ever any good at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.49,1:24:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.91,1:24:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们再也找不回儿子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost our son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.74,1:24:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.99,1:24:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.12,1:24:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是斯诺克的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Snoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.12,1:24:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他把我们的儿子堕入黑暗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seduced our son to the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.83,1:25:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们还有机会救他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can still save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.13,1:25:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.17,1:25:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.05,1:25:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果卢克都找不到他 我怎么可能做到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Luke couldn't reach him, how could I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.47,1:25:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢克是绝地武士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke is a Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.47,1:25:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是他的父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're his father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.51,1:25:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信他还是心存善念的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is still light in him, I know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.39,1:25:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.19,1:25:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}侦查兵报告敌军来袭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the reconnaissance report on the enemy base is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.51,1:25:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.84,1:25:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的地盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my guest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.26,1:25:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他人呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.68,1:25:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你居然把杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mean the murderers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.43,1:26:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叛徒 和小偷称作你的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}traitors, and thieves you call friends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.27,1:26:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该庆幸我不知道他们在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be relieved to hear I have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.73,1:26:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还是想置我于死地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still want to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.61,1:26:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非你摘下那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That happens when you're being hunted…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.36,1:26:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丑陋的面具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by a creature in a mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.22,1:26:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我说说那个机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about the droid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.89,1:26:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他属于BB系列 由硒电池驱动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a BB unit with a selenium drive…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.81,1:26:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带有热扫描器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a thermal hyperscan vindicator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.23,1:26:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}携带一部分的地图数据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's carrying a section of a navigational chart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.44,1:26:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有余下的部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.90,1:26:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从帝国档案中恢复出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recovered from the archives of the Empire…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.78,1:26:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是仍然缺最后一部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we need the last piece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.94,1:26:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你居然说服那个机器人展示给你看了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And somehow you convinced the droid to show it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.03,1:26:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.49,1:26:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个拾荒者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A scavenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.08,1:27:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你该知道我可以知道任何事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can take whatever I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.34,1:27:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你太孤单了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so lonely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.26,1:27:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}害怕离别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So afraid to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.93,1:27:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在夜里绝望地入睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At night, desperate to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.98,1:27:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想象一下大海{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You imagine an ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.52,1:27:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.07,1:27:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看见了岛屿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.41,1:27:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和汉·索洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Han Solo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.03,1:27:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把他当做从未谋面的父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel like he's the father you never had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.83,1:27:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他让你失望了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would have disappointed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.45,1:27:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把手从我的脑袋上拿开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.87,1:27:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你见过地图了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you've seen the map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.00,1:27:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在你的脑子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.09,1:27:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在你得把它展现给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you'll give it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.97,1:28:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别害怕 我能感受到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid. I feel it, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.48,1:28:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会给你展示任何东西的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not giving you anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.61,1:28:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走着瞧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.69,1:28:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.77,1:28:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.82,1:28:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永远都没法和达斯·维德一样强大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you will never be as strong as Darth Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.91,1:29:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个拾荒者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scavenger…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.87,1:29:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}居然能反抗你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}resisted you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.58,1:29:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她原力亲和力很强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is strong with the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.25,1:29:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然没经过训练 但是潜力无穷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Untrained, but stronger than she knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.13,1:29:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个机器人呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the droid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.42,1:29:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伦觉得它对我们没利用价值了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ren believed it was no longer valuable to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.84,1:29:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有那个女孩就够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the girl was all we needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.60,1:29:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以那个机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a result, the droid has most likely been returned…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.14,1:29:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该已经回到敌方的手上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the hands of the enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.39,1:29:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们应该已经得到地图了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They may have the map already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.18,1:29:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一定要赶在抵抗组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the Resistance must be destroyed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.94,1:29:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到天行者之前干掉他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before they get to Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.02,1:29:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们知道他们的位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have their location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.98,1:29:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们的侦查队回到伊利尼姆星系时被我们追踪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tracked their reconnaissance ship to the lleenium system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.61,1:29:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.99,1:29:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我们要一举消灭他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we will crush them once and for all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.95,1:29:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准备好武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare the weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.33,1:29:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至尊领袖 我能从那个女孩那里拿到地图数据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supreme Leader, I can get the map from the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.20,1:29:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要您给我一些指引{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need your guidance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.62,1:29:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你说的关于这个女孩的是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If what you say about this girl is true…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.34,1:30:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把她带来见我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring her to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.98,1:30:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会替我解开枷锁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will remove these restraints…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.23,1:30:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后打开门离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave this cell with the door open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.07,1:30:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.74,1:30:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会替我解开枷锁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will remove these restraints…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.33,1:30:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后打开门离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave this cell with the door open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.84,1:30:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会加固这些枷锁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tighten those restraints…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.51,1:30:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愚蠢的拾荒者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}scum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.86,1:30:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会替我解开枷锁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will remove these restraints…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.52,1:31:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后打开门离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave this cell with the door open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.61,1:31:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会解开枷锁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will remove these restraints…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.28,1:31:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后打开门离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave the cell with the door open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.96,1:31:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你会丢下你的武器 - 我会丢下我的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you'll drop your weapon. - And I'll drop my weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.81,1:31:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.73,1:31:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.40,1:31:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.41,1:31:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开始装载武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begin charging the weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.74,1:31:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.16,1:31:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}武器装载中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapon charging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.72,1:32:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯纳普的侦察飞行器传来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scan data from Snap's reconnaissance flight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.81,1:32:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}扫描数据证实了芬恩的报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}confirms Finn's report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.27,1:32:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们在星球内部建造了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've somehow created a hyper-lightspeed weapon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.31,1:32:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}某种超光速武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}built within the planet itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.77,1:32:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}激光炮吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A laser cannon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.81,1:32:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不知道怎么形容此种规模的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not sure how to describe a weapon of this scale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.77,1:32:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又是一颗死星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's another Death Star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.86,1:32:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么简单就好了 上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish that were the case, Major.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.69,1:32:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个是死星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was the Death Star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.70,1:32:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而这个 是弑星者基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is Starkiller Base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.70,1:32:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 它很大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it's big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.95,1:32:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种规模的武器的能源问题是怎么解决的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it possible to power a weapon of that size?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.16,1:32:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们用的是太阳能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It uses the power of the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.50,1:32:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太阳能会随着武器装载而渐渐耗尽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the weapon is charged…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.79,1:32:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到太阳消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sun is drained until it disappears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.96,1:32:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.97,1:32:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一秩序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The First Order…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.13,1:32:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在正在重新装载他们的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're charging the weapon again now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.51,1:32:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下次目标是我们的星系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our system is the next target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.51,1:32:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.60,1:32:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有共和国的舰队帮助 我们就完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the Republic fleet, we're doomed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.18,1:32:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我们把它炸掉怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. How do we blow it up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.06,1:32:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 总有办法能做到的 - 汉说的没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's always a way to do that. - Han's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.48,1:33:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要成功装载规模如此大的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order for that amount of power to be contained…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.69,1:33:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}基地必须有某种热振荡器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that base has to have some kind of thermal oscillator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.77,1:33:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一个 在第四十七区域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one. Precinct 47.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.53,1:33:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.86,1:33:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们能毁掉这个振荡器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can destroy that oscillator…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.95,1:33:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就可能会破坏武器核心 削弱武器力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it might destabilize the core and cripple the weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.99,1:33:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 或许能摧毁星球 - 我们会去那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe the planet. - We'll go in there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.87,1:33:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朝振荡器和接触到的一切发起攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll hit that oscillator with everything we've got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.33,1:33:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们有战舰无法穿过的保护罩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have defensive shields… that our ships cannot penetrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.83,1:33:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会破坏保护罩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We disable the shields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.33,1:33:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子 你在那工作过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, you worked there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.13,1:33:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道些什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.21,1:33:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以做到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.50,1:33:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜欢这家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.88,1:33:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以关掉保护罩 但我必须在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can disable the shields, but I have to be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.84,1:33:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那颗星球上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.38,1:33:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们送你去 - 汉 你要怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll get you there. - Han, how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.76,1:33:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我告诉你 你不会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I told you, you wouldn't like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.39,1:33:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 我们关掉保护罩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we disable the shields…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.35,1:33:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿下振荡器 然后炸掉大炮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we take out the oscillator and we blow up their big gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.18,1:33:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.38,1:34:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丘伊 检查一下热分摊情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, check that donal capitator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.96,1:34:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.55,1:34:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心点那些东西 那可是炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, be careful with those. They're explosives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.88,1:34:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还要你说啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.05,1:34:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吗 不管我们怎么吵架{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, no matter how much we fought…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.68,1:34:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直都不喜欢看着你离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always hated watching you leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.10,1:34:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是我做到的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.56,1:34:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你会想我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you'd miss me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.81,1:34:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确实向你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did miss you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.07,1:34:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不算很差劲吧 是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't all bad, was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.11,1:34:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一些算是… 挺好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of it was… good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.90,1:34:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.41,1:34:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有些事情是不会变的 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Some things never change. - True.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.83,1:34:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还是让我疯狂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still drive me crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.01,1:34:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你见到我们的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you see our son…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.43,1:35:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带他回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}bring him home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.52,1:35:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长官 吊舱718的传感器被触发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, sensors triggered in Hangar 718.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.27,1:35:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在搜索这个区域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're searching the area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.03,1:35:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她才刚开始试验自己的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just beginning to test her powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.28,1:35:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}越晚找到她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The longer it takes to find her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.03,1:35:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她就越危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more dangerous she becomes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.79,1:35:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有机器人哨兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All sentry droids…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.50,1:35:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有机器人哨兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all sentry droids…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.79,1:35:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟银河系时间同步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resynchronize to Galactic Standard Time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.12,1:35:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偏移473{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Offset 473.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.88,1:35:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要怎么进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we getting in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.09,1:35:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们的保护罩有极小的刷新率{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their shields have a fractional refresh rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.13,1:35:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能阻止所有慢于光速的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeps anything traveling slower than lightspeed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.97,1:35:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}飞行器通过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from getting through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.89,1:35:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要以光速着陆吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're making our landing approach at lightspeed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.43,1:35:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丘伊 做好准备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, get ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.81,1:35:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.42,1:35:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经在提升高度了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am pulling up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.02,1:36:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再高一点他们就会发现我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get any higher… they'll see us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.18,1:36:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长官 718吊舱那边没有发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, she was not found in Hangar 718.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.68,1:36:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但所有部队都戒严了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But all troops are on alert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.85,1:36:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把所有的吊舱都关闭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put every hangar on lockdown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.35,1:36:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她会想要偷一搜战舰逃跑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going to try to steal a ship to esc…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.81,1:36:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汉·索洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han Solo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.41,1:36:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}翻过山脊就是导流洞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The flooding tunnel is over that ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.20,1:36:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们从那边进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get in that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.54,1:36:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在基地里的工作是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was your job when you were based here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.54,1:36:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}搞卫生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanitation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.25,1:36:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}搞卫生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanitation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.21,1:36:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你怎么知道怎么关掉保护罩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how do you know how to disable the shields?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.05,1:36:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.17,1:36:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是来这救蕾伊的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just here to get Rey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.05,1:37:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人们指望着我们 银河系也指望着我们呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are counting on us. The galaxy is counting on us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.72,1:37:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}索洛 我们会找到方法的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solo, we'll figure it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.02,1:37:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以使用原力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll use the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.56,1:37:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原力不是这样用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not how the Force works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.99,1:37:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我好冷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.32,1:37:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗 你还冷吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really? You're cold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.94,1:37:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.37,1:37:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.74,1:37:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}武器还有十五分钟装载成功 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapon charged in 15 minutes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.41,1:37:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.58,1:37:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在这时间越长 运气就越差{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The longer we're here the less luck we're gonna have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.92,1:37:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 保护罩 - 我有个想法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The shields. - I have an idea about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.39,1:37:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 还记得我吗 - FN-2187{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You remember me? - FN-2187.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.93,1:37:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不再是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.35,1:37:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我叫芬恩 现在由我做主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name's Finn and I'm in charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.77,1:37:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在由我做主了 法斯玛 由我做主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in charge now, Phasma. I'm in charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.90,1:37:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 拿下他 拿下他 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bring it down. Bring it down. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.98,1:37:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.29,1:38:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你检查过T17了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you checked out the new T-17s?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.83,1:38:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}T17 我会尽快告诉你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The T-17s, as far as I can tell…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.29,1:38:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想我爆掉你的头吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to blast that bucket off your head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.13,1:38:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关掉保护罩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower the shields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.34,1:38:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你正在犯下一个滔天大错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making a big mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.46,1:39:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}照做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.64,1:39:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}索洛 如果这事有效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solo, if this works…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.84,1:39:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就没有多少时间去找蕾伊了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're not gonna have a lot of time to find Rey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.18,1:39:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别担心 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.35,1:39:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没找到她我们是不会离开这里的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't leave here without her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.56,1:39:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不会那么蠢的相信这事会这么容易吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be so stupid as to think this will be easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.52,1:39:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的部队马上就会到这片区域来杀掉你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My troops will storm this block and kill you all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.19,1:39:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不同意 我们怎么处理她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I disagree. What do we do with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.65,1:39:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里有垃圾倾倒槽吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a garbage chute?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.86,1:39:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}垃圾压缩机呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trash compactor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.37,1:39:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, there is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.78,1:39:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将军 保护罩失效了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, their shields are down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.41,1:39:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢造物主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank the Maker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.08,1:39:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汉做到了 派他们进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han did it. Send them in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.91,1:39:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让波全权负责进攻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give Poe full authorization for attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.92,1:39:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑队组长 速度降到亚光速{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black Leader, go to sub-lights on your call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.29,1:39:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}收到 基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.38,1:39:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}红队 蓝队 听我指令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red squad, Blue squad, take my lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.03,1:39:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将速度降到光速以下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dropping out of lightspeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.06,1:39:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快到射程内了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost in range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.73,1:40:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽全力击中致命点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit the target dead center. As many runs as we can get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.57,1:40:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接近目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Approaching target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.41,1:40:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敌机来袭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighters incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.74,1:40:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们从28.336那里来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming at 28.336.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.41,1:40:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}45 开启保护罩 开启保护罩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forty-five! Shields up! Shields up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.29,1:40:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}派出所有舰队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dispatch all squadrons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.08,1:40:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.42,1:40:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 把它点燃吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's light it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.18,1:40:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 直接命中 - 但没有损坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah, direct hit.- But no damage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.35,1:40:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得持续攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we gotta keep hitting it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.76,1:40:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又一轮轰炸要来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another bombing run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.18,1:40:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}记住 太阳消失时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, when the sun is gone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.55,1:40:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们的武器就装载成功要发射了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}their weapon will be ready to fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.16,1:40:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但只要还有一丝光线 我们就有机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as long as there's light, we got a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.10,1:40:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波主人 敌机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Poe, enemy fighters!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.27,1:40:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计们 有很多客人来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, we got a lot of company!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.96,1:41:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要利用机会把防爆门炸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll use the charges to blow that blast door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.04,1:41:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去吸引火力 但我需要你的掩护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go in and draw fire, but I'm gonna need cover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.88,1:41:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定你要这么做吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you're up for this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.05,1:41:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然不确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.34,1:41:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我进去找蕾伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go in and try to find Rey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.72,1:41:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}部队肯定会跟在我们后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The troopers will be on our tail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.01,1:41:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须做好准备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to be ready for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.22,1:41:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那边还有入口隧道可以通往…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an access tunnel that leads…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.10,1:41:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这是干什么 你这样干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing that? Hmm? Why are you doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.72,1:41:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在做计划呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to come up with a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.48,1:41:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.78,1:41:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.45,1:41:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 还好 - 那就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.16,1:41:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么样了 他伤到你了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you? Did he hurt you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.83,1:41:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芬恩 你来这干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, what are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.18,1:41:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是来救你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came back for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.29,1:41:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd he say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.92,1:41:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说这都是你的主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it was your idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.09,1:41:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.06,1:41:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是怎么跑出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.72,1:41:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没法解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't explain it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.85,1:42:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也不会相信的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you wouldn't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.02,1:42:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在要跑了 等会再抱吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Escape now, hug later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.54,1:42:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我后面跟了一架敌机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got one behind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.20,1:42:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 看到了吗 - 看到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You see it? - Yeah. I'm on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.21,1:42:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我就过去 - 小心地面火力进攻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Burillo's been hit. - Watch out for ground fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.97,1:42:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们有麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.02,1:42:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不能走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.23,1:42:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的朋友带着一整包炸弹呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend's got a bag full of explosives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.31,1:42:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's use them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.06,1:42:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将军 你看到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, are you seeing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.57,1:42:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又有两架X战机被击落了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two more X-wings down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.98,1:42:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们舰队一半战舰都被摧毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's half our fleet destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.45,1:42:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们的武器十分钟内就要装载成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And their weapon will be fully charged in ten minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.20,1:42:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有奇迹发生才能救我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would take a miracle to save us now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.85,1:43:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那姑娘有一套啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl knows her stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.16,1:43:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}隔一根柱子设置一个炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll set the charges against every other column.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.83,1:43:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说对了 这确实是个更好的主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. That's a better idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.87,1:43:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你负责上面 我负责下面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take the top. I'll go down below.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.96,1:43:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}引爆装置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detonator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.71,1:43:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后在这里碰头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll meet back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.80,1:44:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去找他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.57,1:45:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.33,1:45:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汉·索洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han Solo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.17,1:45:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我等这一天已经很久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting for this day for a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.31,1:46:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摘下那个面具 你并不需要它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take off that mask. You don't need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.40,1:46:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我摘下面具 你觉得你会看到什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think you'll see if I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.40,1:46:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我儿子的脸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The face of my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.51,1:46:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你儿子已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.97,1:46:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他跟他的父亲一样虚弱又愚蠢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was weak and foolish like his father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.47,1:46:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我毁了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I destroyed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.31,1:46:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是斯诺克想要你相信的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what Snoke wants you to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.94,1:46:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.98,1:47:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的儿子还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son is alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.15,1:47:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.70,1:47:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最高领袖是明智的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Supreme Leader is wise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.99,1:47:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯诺克只是在利用你的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snoke is using you for your power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.83,1:47:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等他得到想要的东西 他就会杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he gets what he wants, he'll crush you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.88,1:47:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.17,1:47:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.26,1:47:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 并不晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.93,1:47:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我离开这里 跟我回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave here with me. Come home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.43,1:47:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们很想你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We miss you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.57,1:47:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我快被撕裂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm being torn apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.53,1:47:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想摆脱这种痛苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be free of this pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.12,1:47:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道我必须要做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I have to do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.25,1:47:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我不知道 我是否有力量做到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't know if I have the strength to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.29,1:48:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会帮我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you help me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.46,1:48:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会 不论何事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.97,1:48:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.35,1:49:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.11,1:49:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.44,1:50:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}振荡器已经损坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The oscillator's been damaged…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.03,1:50:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但还在运作中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but is still functional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.94,1:50:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}司令 他们的武器还有两分钟就要开火了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral, their weapon will fire in two minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.71,1:50:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}千年隼在这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Falcon's this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.06,1:51:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还没玩完呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not done yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.57,1:51:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是个怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.53,1:51:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在只有我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just us now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.57,1:51:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汉·索洛救不了你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han Solo can't save you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.92,1:51:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.46,1:51:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.05,1:51:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.88,1:51:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不要啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.59,1:51:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.80,1:51:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叛徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.90,1:51:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那把光剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That lightsaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.57,1:51:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}属于我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belongs to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.70,1:51:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来拿啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.18,1:53:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}星际一号被毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just lost R-1.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.89,1:53:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已经不堪重负了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're overwhelmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.27,1:53:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们该怎么办 这样下去是不行的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do? It isn't working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.31,1:53:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑队组长 振荡器上出现了新的空洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black Leader, there's a brand new hole in that oscillator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.56,1:53:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来我们的朋友进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like our friends got in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.11,1:53:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}红队四号 六号 掩护我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red Four, Red Six, cover us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.07,1:53:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我来了 - 收到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm on it. - Roger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.32,1:54:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他人 用尽全力攻击目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody else, hit the target hard. Give it everything you got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.88,1:54:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我这边需要帮助 我需要帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some help here. I need some help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.34,1:54:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 来了 - 小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Coming in! - Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.80,1:54:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我被击中了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.55,1:54:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有小队 我要进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All teams, I'm going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.60,1:54:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来掩护我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up and cover me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.85,1:54:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}收到 黑队组长 祝你好运 波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that, Black Leader. Good luck, Poe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.73,1:54:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三十秒内武器就装载成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapon fully charged in 30 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.11,1:54:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准备开火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare to fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.37,1:56:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你需要一名老师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need a teacher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.67,1:56:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以教你使用原力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could show you the ways of the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.09,1:56:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Force?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.95,1:58:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有人盯紧胎战机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All eyes on that TIE fighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.45,1:58:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在失去能量供给{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're losing power rapidly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.41,1:58:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上尉 回到你的位置上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant! Get back to your station!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.41,1:58:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看周围 我们不会成功的 赫克斯都走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just look! We won't survive. Even Hux is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.83,1:58:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最高领袖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supreme Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.21,1:58:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}燃料电池爆炸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fuel cells have ruptured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.25,1:58:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}星球已经开始崩塌了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The collapse of the planet has begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.59,1:58:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马上离开基地 跟凯洛·伦到我这来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave the base at once and come to me with Kylo Ren.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.72,1:58:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完成他训练的时间到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is time…to complete his training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.35,1:58:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芬恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.10,1:58:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芬恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.44,1:59:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 所有小队 我看到他们了 - 太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All teams, I got eyes on them. - Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.47,2:00:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的工作完成了 回家吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our job's done here. Let's go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.78,2:00:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}轻点 轻点 他受伤了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, easy. He's hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.24,2:00:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有心跳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a heartbeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.59,2:01:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.94,2:01:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你醒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are awake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.30,2:01:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}R2-D2{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2-D2!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.02,2:01:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.98,2:01:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你发现了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.80,2:01:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么能这样叫我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you call me that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.52,2:01:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须得找到卢克主人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to find Master Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.23,2:01:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find Master Luke, how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.07,2:01:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 R2{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.20,2:01:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得马上告诉别人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must go tell the others at once!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.53,2:01:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.70,2:01:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打扰一下 将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.46,2:01:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}R2-D2可能有些急需告诉你的好消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2 may contain some much-needed good news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.63,2:01:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.89,2:02:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波 给我你的地图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poe, I need your map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.47,2:02:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 伙计 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. All right, buddy. Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.32,2:02:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地图 完整了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The map, it is complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.57,2:02:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}LEIAI Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.33,2:02:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my dear friend…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.28,2:02:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真想你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how I've missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.55,2:02:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会再见到对方的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see each other again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.68,2:02:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.77,2:02:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.46,2:03:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.96,2:03:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿原力与你同在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the Force be with you.{\r}
